/* Permissions */
"Accessibility" = "辅助功能";
"Required to identify, open and rearrange other apps' menu bar items, and for hover and click triggers. Basic hiding works without it." = "用于识别、打开和重新排列其他 App 的菜单栏图标，以及悬停和点击触发。不授权时，基础的隐藏功能仍然可用。";
"Screen Recording" = "屏幕录制";
"Optional. Shows the real icons of hidden items in Tuck Bar and the layout editor. Tuck never records your screen. Without it, app icons are shown." = "可选。用于在 Tuck Bar 和布局编辑器中显示隐藏图标的真实样子。Tuck 不会录制你的屏幕。不授权时显示 App 图标。";
"macOS may require a relaunch before new permissions take effect." = "新授予的权限可能需要重启 Tuck 才能生效。";
